              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "| | Now | Target |\n|---|---|---|\n| **pH** | {{ states('sensor.seneye_spec_16_ph') }} | 7.2 \u2013 7.5 |\n| **TDS** | {{ states('sensor.tank_monitor_tds') }} ppm | 180 \u2013 250 |\n| **GH** | {{ states('sensor.aquarium_gh_log') }} | 7 \u2013 8 |\n| **KH** | {{ states('sensor.aquarium_kh_log') }} | 3 \u2013 4 |\n| **Temp** | {{ states('sensor.tank_monitor_water_temperature') }} \u00b0F | 75.8 \u2013 76.5 |\n"
