        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Health",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:heart-pulse"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{% set a = states('sensor.tank_monitor_water_temperature') | float(-999) %}{% set b = states('sensor.seneye_spec_16_temperature') | float(-999) %}{% if a < -900 or b < -900 %}\u26a0\ufe0f **A probe is not reporting** \u2014 controller {{ states('sensor.tank_monitor_water_temperature') }}, Seneye {{ states('sensor.seneye_spec_16_temperature') }}\n{% else %}{% set d = (a - b) | abs | round(2) %}{% if d <= 0.5 %}\u2705 **Probes agree** \u2014 {{ d }} \u00b0F apart\n{% elif d <= 1.5 %}\ud83d\udfe1 **Probes drifting apart** \u2014 {{ d }} \u00b0F\n{% else %}\ud83d\udd34 **Probes disagree by {{ d }} \u00b0F** \u2014 one has failed or drifted\n{% endif %}\nController {{ a }} \u00b0F \u00b7 Seneye {{ b }} \u00b0F{% endif %}"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.seneye_spec_16_temperature",
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": 6
